r\r\n   - Screen With Mouse Pointer Center\r\n   - Screen With Keyboard Focus Center\r\n3. Updated class reference documentation in doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml and code comments in main/main.cpp.\r\n\r\n4. Verification:\r\n1. Verified code style using misc/scripts/file_format.py (Passed).\r\n2. Verified XML structure using Python ElementTree (Passed).\r\n3. Verified documentation integrity with doc/tools/doc_status.py (Passed).\r\n\r\ncloses issue #120656 ","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124082/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124082/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}